From d5baaa046af4f0387fb5ec671bfd1ed853f6c668 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: x <x@x>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 11:56:53 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] cheeseburger: modem W4: WLFW client to mission mode (step 11)

Port of topaz 0122/0124 (TopazModem.cpp, APSL 2.0) as bsd/dev/sweet_wlfw.c with the MSM8998 quirks: 8-bit HOST_CAP daemon_support, no MSA_READY indication (board data after CAP), MSA = last MiB of the modem pool (0xb0f00000, zeroed, hyp-assigned per region to MSS_MSA+WLAN(+CE)), WCN3990 rails L5 0.8 V / L7 1.8 V / L17 1.304 V / L25 3.104 V and RF_CLK2 voted through RPM before IND_REGISTER. Board data bdwlan.bNN by board id, CAP retried 5 times, handshake redone if WLFW restarts, FW_READY -> WLAN_CFG (snoc CE layout) -> WLAN_MODE mission.
---
 bsd/conf/files        |   1 +
 bsd/dev/sweet_glink.c |  15 +-
 bsd/dev/sweet_mlink.h |  34 ++-
 bsd/dev/sweet_mpss.c  |   5 +-
 bsd/dev/sweet_msvc.c  |  35 +--
 bsd/dev/sweet_wlfw.c  | 562 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 6 files changed, 631 insertions(+), 21 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 bsd/dev/sweet_wlfw.c

